ancing usability."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Chips can show multiple interactive elements together in the same area, such as a list of selectable movie times, or a serie of email contacts."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Best suited for category-based filters that do not require additional visual elements."}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OUDSSuggestionChip","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"OUDSSuggestionChip"},"doc://OUDSComponents/documentation/OUDSComponents":{"abstract":[{"text":"The catalog of all components provided by OUDS. It contains also ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"View"},{"type":"text","text":" extensions and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ViewModifiers"},{"type":"text","text":" to apply tokens and styles on components and higher-level views."}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSComponents\/documentation\/OUDSComponents","url":"\/documentation\/oudscomponents","role":"collection","images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_folder_categories.png"}],"type":"topic","title":"Components"}}}